      "generatedCopy": "Qwen Code 0.25.1 fixes a parser boundary where a complete XML tool call quoted inside another tool's parameter value could be recovered and dispatched. Before restoring auto mode, this checklist uses paired harmless canaries: quoted data must leave no execution receipt, while a valid sibling call must still run. It adds a disposable harness, an append-only execution ledger, adapter and authority-mode coverage, and a fail-closed promotion gate. The stable release and tagged tests establish intended behavior; production routes still need their own regression.",
